emies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your resources to power advanced towers</strong> - unless you would rather <strong>sell</strong> <strong>them for intergalactic</strong> <strong>credits</strong>, which can be used to buy one of the <strong>100+ upgrades </strong>to your towers, city or economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deal with</strong> <strong>alien ruins</strong> <strong>and artifacts </strong>that can drastically change the nature of a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and choose one of 15 governors</strong> to govern your colony, each with unique advantages and downsides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a challenge to each run</strong>, which can start with <strong>1-4 lanes</strong>, depending on your level of greed and with<strong> 15 levels </strong>determining how hospitable the planet is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn</strong>, with 5 optional tutorial levels that gradually introduce the game elements to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as you want</strong>! Finishing a run<strong> does not require meta-progression</strong>, with all essential upgrades available from the start.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover Art by Crumpaloo</p>","developers":["ABCA Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192000/76eef63704f029048b34940c0859ee59cc6f4e8c/header.jpg?t=1758738023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6200U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForc